**What landed**
- `workspace.aiMonthlyTokenCap` (nullable int) — admin-settable via `updateWorkspace` under `AI_SETTINGS`, cached through `fromWorkspaceEntityToFlat`, added by a fast 2-39 instance command (`1790807243394` > highest existing).
- `AiMonthlyTokenCapService` sums month-to-date `usageEvent` `AI_CHAT_TOKEN`/`WEB_SEARCH` `quantity` and refuses via typed `AiExceptionCode.MONTHLY_TOKEN_CAP_EXCEEDED`; pure `isMonthlyTokenCapExceeded` fails open on null/0 cap and zero usage.
- Wired into `AiBillingService.assertAiExecutionAllowed` (the single AI pre-execution choke point), scoped to the metered operations so workflow tokens aren't cross-blocked; ordinary work is untouched.

**Checks** — `npx tsgo -p tsconfig.json --noEmit` clean; `ai-billing` specs 3 suites/18 passed + exception-handler spec green; oxlint 0/0 and oxfmt clean on all touched files; no catalog churn.

