d a new tab (e.g. a future \"Usage\"/any tab) within Syna\n1. Add id to `SETTINGS_AI_TABS.TABS_IDS` (`constants/SettingsAiTabs.ts`).\n2. Add an entry to the `tabs` array in `SettingsAI.tsx` (lines 40–71) with `{ id, title: t\\`…\\`, Icon }`.\n3. Add an `isXTab` boolean from `resolvedTabId` and a `{isXTab && <SettingsXTab />}` line (lines 78–83, 141–146).\n4. Optionally add an `actionButton` branch (lines 94–113).\nDeep-links use the hash: `getSettingsPath(SettingsPath.AI, undefined, undefined, 'usage')` (see `modules/settings/usage/components/SettingsUsageAnalyticsSection.tsx:101`).\n\n### How to add a standalone page (e.g. a \"Usage\" page like Providers)\n1. Add enum value to `SettingsPath` (`packages/twenty-shared/src/types/SettingsPath.ts`) e.g. `AiUsage = 'ai/usage'`.\n2. Create the page under `pages/settings/ai/`.\n3. Add a `lazy(() => import(...))` in `SettingsRoutes.tsx` and a `<Route path={SettingsPath.AiUsage} element={...} />` inside the `AI_SETTINGS` group (lines 814–859).\n4. Add a nav entry/subItem in `useSettingsNavigationItems.tsx` (lines 176–184 pattern) if it should appear in the sidebar.\n`getSettingsPath` (`packages/twenty-shared/src/utils/navigation/getSettingsPath.ts`) builds `/{AppPath.Settings}/{to}` with optional params/query/hash.\n\n---\n\n## 2. AI assistant surfaces\n\n### Side panel\n- **`packages/twenty-front/src/modules/side-panel/pages/ask-ai/components/SidePanelAskAiPage.tsx`** — `export const SidePanelAskAiPage` (line 11). Wraps `<AiChatTab />` in `AiChatSurfaceContext.Provider value={AI_CHAT_SURFACE.SIDE_PANEL}`.\n- **Registered:** `modules/side-panel/constants/SidePanelPagesConfig.tsx:61` → `[SidePanelPages.AskAI, <SidePanelAskAiPage />]`.\n- **Enum:** `packages/twenty-shared/src/types/SidePanelPages.ts:20` → `AskAI = 'ask-ai'` (`Copilot` line 11 deprecated → maps to AskAI).\n- **Expand to full page:** `modules/side-panel/pages/ask-ai/hooks/useExpandAskAiSidePanelPage.ts` — `useExpandAskAiSidePanelPage` → `useOpenAiChatPage`.\n\n### Entry points\n- **`packages/twenty-front/src/modules/side-panel/hooks/useOpenAskAiPageInSidePanel.ts`** — `useOpenAskAiPageInSidePanel` (line 13), returns `openAskAiPage({ resetNavigationStack })`; navigates `SidePanelPages.AskAI`, pageTitle `t\\`Syna\\``, `IconSparkles`. Used by command-menu hotkey: `modules/command-menu/hooks/useCommandMenuHotKeys.ts:16,47`.\n- **`packages/twenty-front/src/modules/ai/hooks/useOpenAskAiPageWithPreprompt.ts`** — `useOpenAskAiPageWithPreprompt` (line 14), returns `openAskAiPageWithPreprompt({ text, mode='PREFILL', model?: 'FAST'|'SMART' })`; switches to new chat, optionally preselects `currentWorkspace.fastModel`, then `stageAiChatPreprompt`. Callers:\n  - `modules/blocknote-editor/components/SynaSlashMenuItem.tsx:7,42,61`\n  - `modules/front-components/hooks/useFrontComponentExecutionContext.ts:26,141,366` (maps legacy `SidePanelPages.Copilot` → `AskAI`)\n  - `modules/object-record/record-index/hooks/useOpenRecordFromIndexView.ts:122`\n- **Full page:** `pages/ai-chat/AiChatPage.tsx` — `export const AiChatPage`; route `AppPath.AiChat = '/chat/:threadId?'` (`twenty-shared/src/types/AppPath.ts:22`), registered in `modules/app/routing/utils/createWorkspaceRouteObjects.tsx:147-153`. Opened via `modules/ai/hooks/useOpenAiChatPage.ts` (`openAiChatPage`).\n\n### `modules/ai` component structure (selected)\n- `components/AiChatTab.tsx` — `AiChatTab` (core chat: `AiChatTabMessageList`, `AiChatQueuedMessages`, `AiChatEditorSection`).\n- `components/AiChatEditorSection.tsx` — `AiChatEditorSection`; no-model banner at lines 193–198.\n- `components/AiChatEmptyState.tsx`, `AiChatApiKeyNotConfiguredMessage.tsx`, `AiChatBanner.tsx`, `AIChatNoMoreBillingCreditsBanner.tsx`, `AiChatQuestionCard.tsx`, `AiChatSuggestedPrompts`, `AgentChatProvider*`, plus many effects.\n- `constants/AiChatSurface.ts` — `AI_CHAT_SURFACE = { PAGE: 'page', SIDE_PANEL: 'side-panel' }`.\n- `contexts/AiChatSurfaceContext`.\n- `hooks/`, `states/`, `graphql/`, `utils/` (≈50 ho